{'symbol': 'MAA', 'date': '2022-03-22 16:15:00', 'title': 'MAA ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY COMMON DIVIDEND', 'text': 'GERMANTOWN, TENN. , MARCH 22, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- MAA (NYSE: MAA)\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS APPROVED A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND PAYMENT OF $1.0875 PER SHARE OF COMMON STOCK TO BE PAID ON APRIL 29, 2022, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON APRIL 14, 2022.'}